		<h2>Ethical Concerns</h2>
			<p1>
			If you were to take a deep dive into all of the 
			potential ethical issues that can come from with
			AI you can end up in a deep rabbit hole. The 
			issues could range from a home network security 
			to international espionage and cyber attacks. 
			The list goes on and on. It’s being used across 
			all fields and we need to really take a close 
			look at what we are allowing it to do. For example
			it is being used in the justice system when law 
			firms are preparing for trial.This could lead to 
			things like illegal surveillance practices for data
			gathering, cause new concerns for fairness if the
			AI is biased which it is has been known to be, 
			along with countless other concerns. If the AI 
			was to make a mistake going over the material 
			it could result in the wrong person being either
			convicted or not convicted. That would be a huge 
			consequence. 
			</p1>

